Transom implements Sill's wire protocol. Its message layouts, JSON shapes,
pairing derivations, payload limits and test vectors were transcribed from
Sill's sources (Sources/StreamProtocol, Scripts/sillclient.py and the
documents under docs/), and the comments that describe them paraphrase those
sources. Transom contains no Swift code from Sill. It is not affiliated with
or endorsed by Sill or its author.
